    "ssky_box_image_block_tGJXq9": {
      "type": "ssky-box-image-block",
      "blocks": {
        "section_header_hxQ4FB": {
          "type": "section_header",
          "settings": {
            "section_heading": "<p>Inspiring Children's Learning Materials</p>",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading": "",
            "text_style_subheading": "large-bold",
            "color_class_subheading": "primary-blue",
            "caption": "",
            "text_style": "large-bold",
            "color_class": "primary-blue"
          }
        },
        "text_wCYXHt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Learning should be both exciting and meaningful. Our materials help kids discover important ideas through fun stories, hands-on projects, and good conversations. Our resources are ideal for aiding homeschooling, supplementing schoolwork, or supporting independent learning, and they seamlessly integrate into your child’s day.</p><p>We design every product for both kids and parents. With simple instructions and flexible formats, it’s easy to fit lessons into any schedule. Our resources cover topics like economics, law, and American history, and include engaging books like <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-and-the-road-to-surfdom\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Road to Surfdom</span></a> and <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-and-the-education-vacation\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Education Vacation</span></a>. These materials help start meaningful conversations and build lifelong skills.</p>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "section_header_hxQ4FB",
        "text_wCYXHt"
      ],
